## Scope

Current-apex reconvergence of #2159 onto live Windows PGN/import authority.

Exact parent:
- branch: `converge/current-windows-pgn-generation-import-apex-20261006-zftrkmo`
- SHA: `7acff17b56d1beaf0f0924fa06ab9d00214b4cbe`

#2155's runtime head is already absorbed into this parent; the only parent-side change after #2155 is qualification-workflow state. The three #2159 runtime/test blobs are copied byte-for-byte, then this child adds one exact dual-OS qualification workflow.

### Defect closed

Native Open / Save As dialogs can pump owner-thread callbacks. Content-only fencing did not reject same-content changes to:
- canonical workspace identity;
- source provenance / overwrite-safety authority;
- saved-generation digest;
- recovery-warning generation.

An older modal action could therefore continue after a re-entrant persistence/recovery decision without any PGN byte change.

### Repair

- modal generation retains the exact canonical `PgnWorkspace` object;
- captures content/document revisions and digest;
- captures exact passive source fingerprint, overwrite-safety flag and saved digest;
- captures exact built-in recovery-warning tuple;
- rejects malformed active values before comparison;
- rechecks the same generation after the dialog and at asynchronous Open owner publication.

### Regression evidence

- source-generation change during Save As -> stale, no worker/file publication;
- exact same-content workspace replacement during Save As -> stale;
- source-generation change during Open -> stale, active document preserved;
- recovery-warning generation change during Open -> stale;
- inherited direct-content/workspace revision races remain covered.

### Qualification

`.github/workflows/pgn-modal-persistence-generation.yml` pins the exact current parent and exact 4-path child delta on Ubuntu 22.04 + Windows 2025, compiles the boundary, runs Open/Save worker suites plus adjacent snapshot/passive-ingress/file-workflow regressions, then core selftest.

